WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.943
Detection engineering is the discipline of designing, building, maintaining, measuring,

00:00:04.943 --> 00:00:07.365
documenting, and improving security detections.

00:00:07.365 --> 00:00:13.661
It transforms telemetry into actionable defensive visibility and depends on collaboration across SOC,

00:00:13.661 --> 00:00:18.020
threat hunting, incident response, intelligence, engineering, and operations teams.

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:22.379
Mature programs use lifecycle management, testing, tuning, documentation, metrics,

00:00:22.379 --> 00:00:26.738
and continuous improvement to keep detections useful over time.

00:00:26.738 --> 00:00:30.128
Detection engineering is not simply writing alerts.

00:00:30.128 --> 00:00:35.940
It is the engineering practice of creating reliable visibility into security-relevant activity.
